            }
            lines {
              text: "        \'I rode to Mars tucked under the belly of a larger rover for a 30-day flight test in air just 1% as thick as Earth\342\200\231s. Instead of stopping after 5 flights, I completed 72 flights before a sandy landing damaged my rotor blades in 2024. Which machine am I?\',"
